TITLE Pure water pH 7, 150C, eq with chrysotile + talc
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings tot_Mg_molkgw tot_Si_molkgw
    10 PUNCH TOT("Mg"), TOT("Si")
END
